<title>JAPAN: Key 182nd 10-yr JGB yield closes at record low.</title>
<headline>Key 182nd 10-yr JGB yield closes at record low.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The key 182nd 10-year JGB yield closed at a record low of 2.315 percent on Tuesday after earlier hitting an intra-day record low of 2.310 percent, said Japan Bond Trading Co, Japan's largest inter-dealer broker.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8676</p>
